          "name": "Platform Upsert Apps By Name",
          "request": {
            "name": "Platform Upsert Apps By Name",
            "description": {
              "content": "Idempotently upsert a list of apps by name within the caller's tenant. For each name, returns its existing app id (if the name already exists) or a freshly-generated one (if newly created). Duplicate names in the request are deduplicated server-side. Intended primarily for service-to-service use from accessory writers that materialize app memberships.",
